                                                "sense_id": "87714673-a830-31f5-92a9-11acf0f6fbae",
                                                "text": "When she got downstairs, she would find the house tidy, but dirty. She could not rest until she had thoroughly cleaned; so she went down to the ash-pit with her dustpan."
